+     false-return recovery transfer: DepositRecoveryFailed + full rollback
+PASS AaveV3Strategy.t.sol
+     24 passed; 0 failed; 0 skipped
+PASS ERC4626Strategy.t.sol
+     22 passed; 0 failed; 0 skipped
+PASS Lido / Etherfi / Sky Strategy suites
+     99 passed; 0 failed; 0 skipped
+PASS CollateralVaultStrategy.t.sol
+     119 passed; 0 failed; 0 skipped
+PASS InvariantPushModel.t.sol
+     4 passed; 0 failed; 0 skipped; each 500 runs / 25,000 calls
+PASS full contracts forge test
+     76 suites; 1,433 passed; 0 failed; 1 skipped
+PASS production contract size build
+     CollateralVault runtime 24,575 bytes (EIP-170 margin 1 byte)
+     Aave / ERC4626 / Lido / Etherfi / Sky strategiesもEIP-170内
+PASS upgrade storage layout comparison against fe1c80f8
+     CollateralVaultと全production Strategyでslot / offset / type / gap不変
+PASS selector/build validation
+     deposit(uint256,uint256)=0xe2bbb158、deployUnderlying(uint256)=0x1236d2cc、衝突なし
+PASS df-shared ABI regeneration (`--abis-only`)
